[5. AI CODING RULES & PERFORMANCE CONSTRAINTS]
1. ALWAYS use `backdrop-filter` with fallback: `@supports not (backdrop-filter: blur(1px)) { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }`
2. NEVER use heavy blur values (>40px) on scrolling lists to avoid mobile GPU lag.
3. Keep text high-contrast: Use dark typography (`#0f0f11`) on light glass or pure white (`#ffffff`) on dark glass.
4. Apply `transform: translateZ(0)` or `will-change: transform` on animated liquid glass components for 60fps rendering.
